<h5 id="mark-method-availability-with-the-api_available-macro">Mark method availability with the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">API_AVAILABLE</code> macro</h5>

<div class="language-objc highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><!-- <td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
2
